    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d431">

                <pb facs="0464" n="1198" xml:id="pg1198"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dupuy de Lôme to Mr. Adee.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Swampscott, Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-31"><hi rendition="#italic">August 31,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I offer you sincere thanks for your efficient cooperation and loyal proofs of
                    friendship. The Wilmington episode is at this moment being repeated at New
                    Orleans. I beg you will telegraph the naval and revenue authorities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Dupuy de Lôme</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
